    "body": "This should be a good issue for anyone interested in starting to contribute to starship. We have a helper function in [utils](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/src/utils.rs#L28) that can be used to get the output from stdout or stderr depending on what is populated so should just be a case of updating the dart module to use that and add some additional tests. ",
